## Wiki (Persistent Memory)

**Vault:** `~/WIKI/PROJECT-NAME/obsidian/`

- Session start: hook injects `obsidian/index.md` into context automatically
- "ingest" / "create wiki from daily" / "remember this" → invoke `wiki-ingest` skill
- "lint the wiki" → `uv run --directory ~/WIKI/PROJECT-NAME/compiler python scripts/lint.py`
